  "stderr": "Error: Cannot run check for manifest: /home/vulcan/personal/zettacore/ai-tools/aidrift-project/aidrift-code/packages/cli/tests/fixtures/check/malformed-manifest/.aistate.yml
  Code: manifest.schema.invalid
  Reason: [manifest.schema.invalid] Missing required field "name".; [manifest.schema.invalid] Missing required field "artifacts".; [manifest.schema.invalid] Missing required field "eval".; [manifest.schema.invalid] Missing required field "storage".; [manifest.schema.invalid] Schema validation failed at "/": must NOT have additional properties.
