  Docs: ../aidrift-docs/MANIFEST-SPEC.md
",
  "stdout": "",
}
`;

exports[`aidrift check > snapshots github output-file contract for missing-baseline 1`] = `
{
  "exitCode": 2,
  "outputFile": "",
  "stderr": "Error: No snapshot found to use as baseline.
  Code: check.baseline.missing
  Reason: aidrift check requires at least one snapshot to compare against.
  Fix: Run 'aidrift snapshot' to capture a baseline, then re-run check.
  Docs: ../aidrift-docs/PHASES/11-github-workflow-integration.md
",
  "stdout": "",
}
`;

